== Highlighted code

```php
$html = $carve->named('comments')->render($source);
```

== Disclosures

::: details "Why a container-resolved extension?"
`App\Carve\DisclosureExtensions` is named by its class in `extensions`, so Tempest builds it.
:::

The ending is a :spoiler[safe render], revealed in static mode.
